# 2027 Tournament Announcement

Hello GGSO Community,

The 11th annual Division C Golden Gate Science Olympiad Invitational will be hosted **in person at UC Berkeley on Sunday, January 31st, 2027**! Registration details will be announced in an upcoming announcement.

As always, we hope to create an unforgettable competition experience for all teams. To help us plan for this season’s invite, please let us know your Awards Ceremony preferences via this  <a target="_blank" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScy9CJ8dh4dw4xqJsIrRXSV61s2EOfLyK04LF01i8kHczNb5A/viewform?usp=publish-editor">form</a>.

Additionally, we are planning on selling merchandise! We want to hear what products you may be interested in purchasing. This <a target="_blank" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfQDJUif-UhjzyuG766W1c38Y_GprmSV5iFeFPE99-QGNH8vQ/viewform?usp=dialog">form</a> is meant to simply gauge interest; information about designs and how to order will be sent out later. 

Feel free to email us with any questions or suggestions. We can’t wait to welcome you back to the UC Berkeley campus!

